[[63,7,2,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Open the bonnet</p><p>Disconnect the positive battery terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584661\">3330C40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584659\">3330C34</a></p><p>1. Open the band (1a) retaining the pipe (1b) to the clutch pump\n(1c) and remove it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2022535.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,2,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Connect the pipe to the clutch pump and\nclose the retaining band.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584659\">3330C34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584661\">3330C40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584131\">0010T67</a></p><p>Connect the positive battery terminal.</p><p>Close the bonnet lid.</p>"]]